  "title": "Be Aware of How Media Affects You, Not Just Others",
  "description": "Be aware of how media affects you, not just others. Here’s how: - Reflect on impact: Ask, “How might this message shape my beliefs or actions?” - Fact-check frequently: Don’t assume you’re immune to misinformation or bias. - Discuss with others: Share perspectives to see how media affects you both differently. Example: If a news story sparks a strong reaction, pause and question how it’s influencing your thoughts or feelings.",
